              "slot_position": 1,
              "svg": null,
              "diagram": null,
              "rationale": "The semiperimeter is \\(21\\text{ cm}\\), so the area is \\(\\sqrt{21\\cdot8\\cdot7\\cdot6}=84\\text{ cm}^2\\)."
            },
            {
              "id": "96_text_cm_2_2",
              "label": "\\(96\\text{ cm}^2\\)",
              "is_correct": false,
              "slot_position": 2,
              "svg": null,
              "diagram": null,
              "rationale": "This results from an incorrect substitution in Heron's formula."
            },
            {
              "id": "72_text_cm_2_3",
              "label": "\\(72\\text{ cm}^2\\)",
              "is_correct": false,
              "slot_position": 3,
              "svg": null,
              "diagram": null,
              "rationale": "The product under the square root is \\(7056\\), whose square root is \\(84\\)."
